      formula: String.raw`G_{\mathbb Q^{\mathrm{ab}}} \cong \hat F_\omega`,
      text: "The absolute Galois group of the maximal abelian extension ℚ<sup>ab</sup> of ℚ is a free profinite group on countably many generators. Known for the analogous function fields over finite fields (Harbater, Pop) and implies that every finite group is a Galois group over ℚ<sup>ab</sup>.",
